`prompt_text`（转录文本）可显著提高质量。\n\n  ---\n\n ## 多说话人\n\n  在文本中使用 `[speaker_N]:` 标签：\n  [嘉宾1]：大家好，欢迎来到节目！\n  [speaker_2]：感谢邀请我！\n  [发言人1]：让我们开始吧。\n\n  ---\n\n ## 链接\n\n - 原始 [LongCat-AudioDiT](https://github.com/meituan-longcat/LongCat-AudioDiT)\n - 模型 [3.5B](https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B) / [3.5B-bf16](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B-bf16) / [3.5B-fp8](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B-fp8)\n - 问题 [报告错误](https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-LongCat-AudioDIT-TTS/issues)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [361.8236999511719, 384.01214599609375], "pos": [1728.6787109375, 113.76528930664062], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["参考音频文案，要求一样！"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [1137.8525390625, 1141.8675537109375], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["提示词"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [1123.02294921875, 871.8811645507812], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-999.6624030929415, -656.0313292717927], "scale": 1.4122927695244547}}, "groups": [], "links": [[10, 1, 0, 13, 0, "AUDIO"], [11, 3, 0, 13, 2, "STRING"], [12, 5, 0, 13, 3, "STRING"], [14, 13, 0, 7, 0, "AUDIO"]], "id": "8ee3f53f-b131-4ec1-847d-7ca92a9ca0f4", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 14, "revision": 0}